flowchart LR
  C["<b>1. Clients</b><br/>AI agents (MCP)<br/>Admin web UI<br/>synaptree-client<br/>chokidar, 500 ms debounce"]
  S["<b>2. Server (Node ESM)</b><br/>MCP tools: stdio + SSE /sse<br/>REST /api/v1 (sync, erd, trace)<br/>Optional bearer auth<br/>Read-only guard (403 on writes)<br/>Tokens-saved estimate (get_usage)"]
  E["<b>3. Indexing engine</b><br/>Pass 1: Tree-sitter definitions (WASM)<br/>Pass 2: linker, heuristic CALLS / USAGE"]
  G["<b>4. Graph DB</b><br/>Neo4j 5, bundled, swappable<br/>tenant: user_id, repo_name"]
  R["<b>5. Read-only sources</b><br/>Your repo (never modified)<br/>SQL / ODBC / Oracle / Mongo<br/>schema only, no row values"]
  L["<b>LLM (optional)</b><br/>Local or API endpoint<br/>Paid-API guardrails: 50k approve,<br/>100k strong warning, daily budget"]
  C --> S --> E --> G
  S --> R
  L --> S
  N["Read-only by design: only the synaptree index is written<br/>(graph, annotations, ADRs, saved schemas)"]
